# Local env files — never commit secrets or token-bearing embed URLs
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# .env.production holds only VITE_* values, which are PUBLIC (baked into the
# client bundle) — committing it lets `vite build` (e.g. for the Capacitor APK)
# target the right backend without a shell env var. Never put secrets in it.
!.env.production

